    <deploymentStatus>Deployed</deploymentStatus>
    <description>Holds data from Powerfaids application relevant to a lead or contact. Data will be fed into Salesforce via Integration from Powerfaids. Integration uses matching criteria to first find a matching contact. If one is found, the Contact record of this object will be populated with that ID. If one is not found, the same process follows with the Lead field. Integration will create a Lead and match it to this record if a Lead is not found. Flow exists to populate this new field upon lead conversion.</description>
